    "certificate": {
      "type": "content-columns",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "blue",
        "layout": "list",
        "numbered": false,
        "heading": "On certification",
        "head_note": "<p>The most important thing on this page, so it comes first.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "No certificate has been issued",
            "body": "<p>Not by us, not by anyone else, not yet. A brand cannot award itself one, and we are not going to imply approval we do not have by leaving the question unanswered.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What we can state instead",
            "body": "<p>The physical facts: what the membrane is, how the sock is constructed, and how it behaves. Those are checkable. The ruling is not ours to make.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "i1",
        "i2"
      ]
    },
    "conditions": {
      "type": "content-columns",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "paper",
        "layout": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "heading": "The three properties, one at a time"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Waterproof",
            "body": "<p>A licensed Porelle\u00ae membrane sealed between two knitted layers. Water does not pass through it. This is the same membrane in every HydroSox pair, not a separate wudu version.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Holds its shape",
            "body": "<p>Structured so it stays a covering over the foot rather than collapsing flat against it when worn.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Stays on the foot",
            "body": "<p>A close, shaped fit that stays in place through normal wear, rather than working loose over a day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "i1",
        "i2",
        "i3"
      ]
    },
    "credentials": {
      "type": "content-columns",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "wash",
        "layout": "list",
        "numbered": false,
        "heading": "Why this pair rather than another",
        "head_note": "<p>The differentiator is the named membrane. Everything else in this category tends to be asserted rather than evidenced.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The membrane is named and licensed",
            "body": "<p>Porelle\u00ae is a third-party laminate. You can look it up, and someone other than us stands behind it. Compare that with an unnamed waterproof layer.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Three layers, each specified",
            "body": "<p>Lining, membrane, wear face. The construction page sets out what each one is for.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "PFOA free, stated",
            "body": "<p>Printed because it is true, not because it tests well.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "i1",
        "i2",
        "i3"
      ]
    },
    "travel": {
      "type": "content-columns",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "paper",
        "layout": "list",
        "numbered": false,
        "heading": "Hajj, Umrah and travel"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Long days away from home",
            "body": "<p>Pilgrimage travel means long days, shared ablution facilities and little chance to dry anything properly. A pair that keeps water out and can be washed cool and air-dried overnight is doing useful work.</p>"
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Multiples, not singles",
            "body": "<p>Most people buying for travel buy more than one pair. The quantity ladder on this page prices that in rather than treating it as a bulk request.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "i1",
        "i2"
      ]
